<title>ITALY: Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</title>
<headline>Gross yields rise at Italian Btp bond auction.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Auction results for a fifth tranche of 3.0 trillion lire worth of three-year Italian Treasury fixed rate bonds (Btp) with a 6.00 pct coupon, and a fifth tranche of 2.5 trillion lire of five-year Btps carrying a 6.25 pct coupon.</p>
<p>		   Jan 1, 2000   pvs	Jan 1, 2002	pvs</p>
<p> Net Yield	 5.40 pct    5.19	  5.62 pct	5.46</p>
<p> Gross Yield     6.18 pct    5.96	  6.44 pct	6.28</p>
<p> Assigned price 99.75	100.30	 99.60	  100.25</p>
<p> Bids	     5.038 trln lire	   3.928 trln lire</p>
<p> Assigned	 3.000 trln lire	   2.500 trln lire</p>
<p>Note - Comparisons are with a previous auction on January 16.</p>
</text>
